WEBVTT

00:00:29.096 --> 00:00:31.172
(Risos)

00:00:31.316 --> 00:00:34.318
(Aplausos)

00:00:37.266 --> 00:00:40.765
Vimos quatro presidentes norte-americanos.

00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:42.180
Obama, claro.

00:00:42.224 --> 00:00:44.558
Oh, os europeus adoraram-no.

00:00:44.622 --> 00:00:46.877
Ele era multilateralista.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.503
Favorecia a diplomacia.

00:00:48.537 --> 00:00:50.557
Queria ser amigo do Irão.

00:00:51.187 --> 00:00:54.215
(Risos)

00:00:57.831 --> 00:00:59.039
E depois...